# The build context for every image here is the repo root (the apps import
# workspace packages). Images install their own dependencies for Linux, so
# nothing built on the host goes in, and neither do secrets or local state.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.data
data/
.env*
!.env.example
.git
.github
.context
.wayfinder
e2e/test-results
e2e/.auth
playwright-report
test-results
**/.DS_Store
